sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as User (Client)
    participant UI as Frontend (AnalyzeFood.tsx)
    participant API as FastAPI Router (/api/analyze)
    participant CV as MobileNetV3 Classifier
    participant Gemini as Gemini Vision (classify_food_with_gemini)
    participant USDA as USDA Nutrition Service

    User->>UI: Uploads ambiguous food image (e.g., Samosa classified as Apple Pie @ 43.9%)
    UI->>API: POST /api/analyze (multipart/form-data)
    API->>CV: predict(image_bytes)
    CV-->>API: {predicted_class: 'apple_pie', confidence: 0.439, is_confident: false}
    
    Note over API: Confidence 43.9% < 70% threshold.<br/>Trigger Gemini Vision Multimodal Fallback.<br/>STRICT POLICY: Withhold definitive nutrition.
    
    API->>Gemini: classify_food_with_gemini(image_bytes)
    Note over Gemini: Analyze visual features:<br/>- Triangular golden-brown pastry<br/>- Crisp fried pastry crust<br/>- Identifies: 'Samosa'
    Gemini-->>API: {suggested_food: 'Samosa', confidence: 'High', explanation: 'Golden triangular pastry...', category_match: 'samosa'}
    
    API-->>UI: AnalyzeImageResponse {<br/>  classification: {predicted: 'Apple Pie', confidence: 0.439, is_confident: false},<br/>  nutrition: null,<br/>  gemini_fallback: {suggested_food: 'Samosa', ...},<br/>  requires_confirmation: true<br/>}

    Note over UI: UI displays:<br/>1. Warning: "Low confidence identification"<br/>2. Gemini Vision Suggestion Card ("Samosa")<br/>3. Action Button: "Confirm Samosa & View Nutrition"<br/>4. Alternative Predictions list with "Select" buttons<br/>5. Manual 20-category dropdown override<br/>6. "Nutritional Data Pending Confirmation" Card

    alt User clicks "Confirm Samosa & View Nutrition"
        User->>UI: Clicks "Confirm Samosa & View Nutrition"
        UI->>API: GET /api/nutrition/Samosa?category_key=samosa
        API->>USDA: get_nutrition_for_food('Samosa', 'samosa')
        USDA-->>API: NutritionData (262 kcal, 4.4g protein, 32.2g carbs, 13.0g fat per 100g)
        API-->>UI: 200 OK (Verified USDA Nutrition)
        UI-->>User: Displays verified Samosa NutritionCard
    else User clicks an Alternative Prediction (e.g., Spring Rolls)
        User->>UI: Clicks "Select Spring Rolls"
        UI->>API: GET /api/nutrition/Spring%20Rolls?category_key=spring_rolls
        API->>USDA: get_nutrition_for_food('Spring Rolls', 'spring_rolls')
        USDA-->>API: NutritionData for Spring Rolls
        API-->>UI: 200 OK
        UI-->>User: Displays verified Spring Rolls NutritionCard
    else User chooses Manual Dropdown
        User->>UI: Selects food from 20-category dropdown
        UI->>API: GET /api/nutrition/{selected_food}?category_key={key}
        API->>USDA: get_nutrition_for_food(...)
        USDA-->>API: NutritionData
        API-->>UI: 200 OK
        UI-->>User: Displays NutritionCard
    end
